Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:09.86,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord2\pos(243.5,192)\c&H0A0F12&\3c&H474E4D&}Hail to the King
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:12.20,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:15.51,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,Aya-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.51,0:00:16.43,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:19.12,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,You're awfully late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.49,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,I was getting tired of waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:24.12,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Yesterday's {\i1}Best Western Hits{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:26.63,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,I recorded it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.50,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,New songs!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:31.99,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:33.87,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:37.56,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,The third track is so dope.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:41.43,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,It hits you like a knuckle sandwich \Nin a one-on-one street fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:45.19,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,I don't think I really get what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.75,0:00:46.74,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.74,0:00:50.85,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,I learned how to sing all the songs \Nyou gave me last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.85,0:00:52.11,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,No kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:53.19,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.19,0:00:54.60,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,Why don't you play?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:55.91,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,We can sing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.19,0:00:58.20,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,Aya-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.18,0:01:01.45,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Hey, Fu...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.27,0:01:09.71,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,How about the two of us go pro?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.36,0:01:13.84,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,I feel like with you on board, we can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:17.22,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:19.97,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:55.52,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(278,1)\3c&H451E10&}The Star of the Next Video is Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:06.95,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay. Guess that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:12.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:14.70,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,A nice room with plenty of space.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.70,0:03:18.23,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The question is whether \NI can survive living with {\i1}them{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:21.47,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\fs30\bord2.5\fnArial Black\c&H3D403E&\3c&HEDF1EC&}Let's reach 1,000,000 subs!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:22.86,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I've gotta do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.86,0:03:25.72,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll come up with videos \Nthat are sure to go viral!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:27.47,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And to do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:29.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"Favorite things:"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:32.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"Strawberries, dustpans, \Nlong chopsticks, Live-sama,"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:36.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"holo stickers, smooth rocks, cosmic peace."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:36.98,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,848)\alpha&H22&\an7\bord0\blur0.2\pos(20,20)\p1\c&HEDF1EC&\fscx245\fscy153}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.98,0:03:36.98,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,848)\an7\fs15\c&H797D7A&\u1\pos(30,30)}Please fill out this survey{\u0}\N\NName: {\fnComic Sans MS}Ichiko\N\N{\fnArial}Favorite Things: {\fnComic Sans MS}Strawberries,\Ndustpans, long chopsticks, Live-sama <3,\Nholo stickers, smooth rocks, cosmic peace\N\N{\fnArial}Skills: {\fnComic Sans MS}Stocks, cleaning, forex,\Nlaundry, cooking
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.34,0:03:39.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Dumb as a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:41.36,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Huh? Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:42.91,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Nope, not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:44.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Strawberries are good, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:46.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now for Live...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:49.30,Default,Live,0,0,0,,{\i1}My{\i0} favorite thing is the\N blood flowing in your veins!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.30,0:03:49.93,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.93,0:03:50.74,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:52.04,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:56.33,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,You want to know more about us \Nso badly, you printed out surveys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:03:57.92,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Nosy, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:03:59.46,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H22&\an7\bord0\blur0.2\pos(20,20)\p1\c&HF99EED&\fscx183\fscy180}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.92,0:03:59.46,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs15\c&HA8085C&\u1\pos(30,30)}Please fill out this survey{\u0}\N\NName:\N{\fnArial Black\fs30}TOKAGE!!\N\N{\fs15\fnArial}Favorite Things:\N{\fnArial Black\fs30}MONEY!!!\N\N{\fs15\fnArial}Skills:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.46,0:04:01.77,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yeah, I expected as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:03.73,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.73,0:04:05.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wasn't there another one of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:07.45,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Fu's out at work right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:08.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What, she has a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.92,0:04:09.57,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.57,0:04:14.44,Default,Live,0,0,0,,{\i1}One{\i0} of our residents is a hard-working girl \Nwho has a real job and pays her rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:16.61,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Cut it out. You're making me blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.61,0:04:18.27,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.27,0:04:19.68,DefaultTop,Tokage,0,0,0,,No need to be bashful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:21.15,DefaultTop,Live,0,0,0,,Like hell I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:25.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Job or no job, I need her \Nto submit a survey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:30.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:35.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Totally blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:41.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.86,0:04:49.99,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:58.68,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki, what are you doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:04:59.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:03.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I know what our next video's going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:11.87,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.61,0:05:21.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, here she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:22.09,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Hey, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:23.38,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,You two!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.38,0:05:24.88,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,How'd you get in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:25.92,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Through the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:27.06,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,That's trespassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.06,0:05:28.61,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Bath thieves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.61,0:05:31.78,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Hey, don't be such a party pooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:33.73,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,We're closed for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.73,0:05:35.06,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:36.75,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We'll get going, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:38.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:41.31,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Allow us to announce our next video.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:43.95,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The star of the next video is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:45.99,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The one singing a cover will be Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.39,0:05:47.22,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.02,0:05:51.02,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,N-No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:51.99,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:56.37,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,How many times do I have \Nto tell you I won't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:57.64,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Whew!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:05:59.47,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Nothing beats a cold one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:06:00.79,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Please listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.13,0:06:03.17,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Why me, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:07.05,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Because I found out you can sing. Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:09.92,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:11.77,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you went in my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:13.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Whether I did or didn't isn't the issue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:19.31,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You love singing, and you used to sing \Non the roof all the time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.65,0:06:20.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.76,0:06:21.50,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:23.36,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,You could... hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:27.07,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now's the time to try \Nnew ideas to rack up the hits!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:29.16,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Videos of song covers are popular,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:32.07,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and there's a good chance \Nit could gain us subs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:35.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Got it? If you do, then hurry up and—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:36.58,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,You're so stubborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:41.70,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san, you're as stubborn as\N the slimy gunk in the bathtubs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:42.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.20,0:06:43.71,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's one hell of a weird insult!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:46.34,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I'll never sing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.61,0:06:50.72,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I don't deserve to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.51,0:06:53.04,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:09.82,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:10.82,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.19,0:07:13.07,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:16.09,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Starting tomorrow, how about \Nwe sing here every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:18.81,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:20.58,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,I'd love to sing with you every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.85,0:07:24.21,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,If we're gonna be pro singers, \Nwe need to get real!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:27.42,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,That's... true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:29.39,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:31.71,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Having second thoughts about the audition?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.71,0:07:33.51,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,No, that's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:36.51,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Then we've gotta buckle down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.51,0:07:38.02,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Let's kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:39.61,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.77,0:07:43.69,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:50.17,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:54.90,FlashbackItalics,Singer,0,0,0,,Thank you for hearing us perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:56.54,Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.01,0:07:59.93,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,Yuki-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:01.46,Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,A pro singer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:03.30,Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,Do you plan on being on TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:04.46,Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,As a {\i1}vampire?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.09,0:08:06.57,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,How do you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:09.94,Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,My job is to keep an eye on you lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:13.53,Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,A singer who miraculously doesn't age,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:16.74,Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,shrouded in mystery, \Nonly making appearances at night...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.24,0:08:19.10,Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,It'll get people talking, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:22.29,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,I know it's a lost cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:24.33,Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,I don't think you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.77,0:08:33.78,Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,Don't cling to a dream \Nthat can never come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:37.86,FlashbackItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Gotta tell her...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.23,0:08:40.60,FlashbackItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Gotta tell her...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.37,0:08:42.72,FlashbackItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Gotta tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.41,0:08:44.75,FlashbackItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Gotta tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.08,0:08:46.63,FlashbackItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Gotta tell her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:48.63,FlashbackItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Gotta tell her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:01.22,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs10\bord2\c&HB3AC93&\3c&H393132&\move(344,148,344,346.5,23,2067)}Open-Air Concert Hall
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.74,0:09:04.09,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,An outdoor stage...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:05.48,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,1)\bord2\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\c&H6C6965&\3c&HACA49A&\move(528,88,407,88,21,3941)}Shine On! Singing Contest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:14.19,FlashbackItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,I can't back down now. \NNot after all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.63,0:09:16.57,FlashbackItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,I mean, if I did...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:18.53,FlashbackItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,That'd be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:25.41,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,What's up? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.41,0:09:26.77,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,Aya-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:28.54,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.37,0:09:31.55,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:33.46,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Let's make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:35.30,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,The two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.83,0:09:41.10,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:42.57,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Nerves getting to ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:44.65,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,This is no time to be shaking in your boots!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:47.21,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,L-Listen, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.05,0:09:50.44,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,Aya-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:53.42,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Guess I'm not one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:55.60,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,My folks...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:58.13,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,They keep giving me a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:10:00.37,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Saying my dream can never come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:03.01,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Shut up. What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.01,0:10:05.54,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,I'm banking on this audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:12.88,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,Wh-Why'd you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:14.93,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Firing myself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.93,0:10:16.26,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,F-Firing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:19.26,FlashbackItalics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Next up is entry number 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:21.26,FlashbackItalics,Announcer,0,0,0,,The two-piece act, Who Are You!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.26,0:10:22.28,FlashbackItalics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Step on up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:23.76,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\c&H847976&\3c&HC2B9AC&\move(396.5,75,369.5,75,27,2238)\t(27,2238,\c&HB8A5CB&\3c&HF5ECE6&)}Shine On! Singing Contest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:30.16,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Here we go, Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:10:59.08,FlashbackItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:02.81,FlashbackItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,I can't even go out in the sunlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.83,0:11:04.76,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Fu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.45,0:11:09.61,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:14.98,Flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.01,0:11:28.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.41,0:11:31.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"Don't deserve to"? \NWhat's {\i1}that{\i0} supposed to mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:34.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You were singing so happily!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:37.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So how come?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.37,0:11:38.92,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:40.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.19,0:11:42.35,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why are you coming in through the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.35,0:11:44.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait, where'd you go off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:46.27,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Here and there for some Fu stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:51.06,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I had an idea of what all this was about, \Nso I got some answers out of Shige.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:53.69,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Shige... Yuki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.45,0:11:57.31,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,All right. Since the song cover \Nvideo's riding on this, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.31,0:11:58.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,let's really put our backs into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:00.19,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:07.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H79E9BC&\3c&H3D4FD3&\frz-10.84\fax-0.1\move(245,16,484.5,86.5,23,1899)}The Folk
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:07.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H3A532F&\3c&H6DF1E2&\frz321.2\move(279.5,195,517.5,264,24,1859)}All About Folk Songs
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.53,0:12:07.41,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H305223&\3c&H7AB462&\frz-28.5\fax-0.15\move(367,96.5,601,164,28,1863)}New Music
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:10.70,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(318,137)\bord2\fs9\c&HD3D9D8&\frz8.065\3c&H888B88&\pos(342,255.5)}Shine On! Singing Contest!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:10.70,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(318,137)\bord4\fs14\c&H949895&\3c&HD4D7D5&\frz8.065\pos(344.5,267.5)}Singer-Songwriter\NAudition
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:10.70,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(318,137)\bord3\fs9\c&H949895&\3c&HD4D7D5&\frz8.065\pos(348,303)}Step up, hotshots! Coming this fall!!!\NWill you be the next big TV star?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:10.70,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(318,137)\bord3\fs10\c&HE7ECE9&\frz8.065\3c&H888B88&\pos(352,322.5)}Stay Tuned for Updates!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:10.70,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(318,137)\bord3\fs16\fnArial Black\c&H929794&\frz4.727\3c&HECF4F1&\pos(560.5,146.5)}Japanese Folk\N& Rock Feature
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.37,0:12:13.54,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,141)\fs14\3c&HFAFFFC&\c&H888C8E&\pos(381,55.5)}Live\N{\c&HA3A8A7&}We're searching for this person!\NAll info is welcome, so please\Nleave a comment if you know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.37,0:12:15.13,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H888C8E&\fs9\frz357.5\pos(83,26.5)\3c&HFAFFFC&}A Community for\NFolk Song Lovers
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:15.13,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(187,1)\fs14\3c&HFAFFFC&\c&H888C8E&\pos(384,49)}Mr. Bear\N{\c&HA3A8A7&}Who is she? Quite the looker\N\N{\c&H888C8E&}Milk\N{\c&HA3A8A7&}how old is that photo? lmao\N\N{\c&H888C8E&}Party of One\N{\c&HA3A8A7&}I don't know who she is...\NIs she a family member?\N\N{\c&H888C8E&}Akari\N{\c&HA3A8A7&}She looks tough as nails LOL\NIs she one of them delinquent girls??\N\N{\c&H888C8E&}S.H\N{\c&HA3A8A7&}who's that? someone famous?\N\N{\c&H888C8E&}Marguerite\N{\c&HA3A8A7&}No clue\N\N{\c&H888C8E&}the sake liker\N{\c&HA3A8A7&}Never seen her, but I hope\Nyou find her soon <3
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:17.11,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:21.38,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H888D8C&\3c&HFCFFFC&\pos(347,15)}the sake liker\N{\c&HB0B3B0&}Never seen her, but I hope\Nyou find her soon <3\N\N{\c&H888D8C&}Sinji\N{\c&HB0B3B0&}Whoa, she's awesome!!\N\N{\c&H888D8C&}Yumi Kimura Smith\N{\c&HB0B3B0&}I saw her play a concert two years ago.\NI think this is the same AYA-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.61,0:12:22.78,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.69,0:12:30.10,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Um, Masaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:32.35,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Y-You scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.35,0:12:34.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't sneak up behind me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:36.60,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to sneak up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:38.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, um, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:41.26,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,You've been acting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:42.65,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Are you up to something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:46.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No way! I wouldn't dream of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:48.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's nothing at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:49.03,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.03,0:12:50.76,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Wait right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:53.40,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,You really suck at telling lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:55.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:56.70,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I can see right through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.65,0:13:01.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let me tell you what's up, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:03.78,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We went looking for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:05.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The girl named Aya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:08.05,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,How do you know that name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:09.71,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We looked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.31,0:13:15.39,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Do you really want me to sing that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:18.77,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So she {\i1}is{\i0} the reason why you won't sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:19.65,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.89,0:13:24.65,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,It was my own decision not to sing anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.65,0:13:26.76,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Aya-chan's got nothing to do with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:28.95,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Why do you keep sticking \Nyour nose in my business?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.29,0:13:30.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm doing it for the videos—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:34.45,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,No one will enjoy watching me be pressured \Ninto something I don't want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:35.95,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:39.28,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Please just leave me be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.28,0:13:40.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Fine, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:43.71,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Piss and moan until you die, for all I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:46.47,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I saw how carefully you kept \Nthose ancient cassettes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.86,0:13:49.38,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's obvious that you're still not over her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:56.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We received word of someone named \NAya holding a concert two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.17,0:13:59.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We found the venue location, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.43,0:14:01.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:03.89,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.89,0:14:04.73,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:06.39,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Then throw it in the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.25,0:14:11.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You said you don't deserve to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.07,0:14:16.75,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Just so you know, no one's undeserving \Nof doing the things they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.15,0:14:18.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's all from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.66,0:14:26.82,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.82,0:14:27.94,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:29.76,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Fu left a message!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:33.39,Default,Live,0,0,0,,"I'll be out of the house for a while. \NDon't worry about me."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.82,0:14:34.94,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:37.52,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Is it because of all our meddling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:40.94,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,She said not to worry. I'm sure she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:55.56,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:01.26,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I should have done more research.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.26,0:15:03.88,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,My phone stopped working \Nas soon as I got here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.74,0:15:07.42,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I'm even dumber than Ichiko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:11.96,Default,Woman 1,0,0,0,,You've had way too much to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:13.80,Default,Woman 2,0,0,0,,I feel sick...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.59,0:15:13.80,DefaultTop,Fu,0,0,0,,Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:14.81,Default,Woman 2,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:16.15,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.14,0:15:20.41,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Can you tell me how to find this address?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:27.15,Default,Band Member 1,0,0,0,,That was a good show, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.15,0:15:28.46,Default,Band Member 2,0,0,0,,Yeah, we nailed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:30.01,Default,Band Member 1,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's have a beer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:39.08,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:46.36,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Aya-chan performed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:55.72,Default,Owner,0,0,0,,Sorry, we're closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:58.59,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,U-Um, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.95,0:16:01.98,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,This case...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:02.88,Default,Owner,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:03.73,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3E679F&\3c&H98C7F8&\pos(475.5,23)}Hail to the King
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.88,0:16:03.73,Default,Owner,0,0,0,,Don't touch that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.37,0:16:06.48,Default,Owner,0,0,0,,That guitar's precious to me, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:11.28,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,300)\bord2.5\fnTimes New Roman\c&H282F62&\3c&HA1AED9&\pos(475.5,23)}Hail to the King
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:12.79,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Aya-chan's guitar case...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.21,0:16:16.12,Default,Owner,0,0,0,,You a friend of Aya or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:20.49,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I-I'm Aya-chan's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:23.89,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Um, English... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:32.78,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You think Fu managed to find Aya-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:34.26,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm sure she did!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.32,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Good for her, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:38.77,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Fu managed to take a bold new step.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:39.98,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:42.99,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Now we might make some cash!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.99,0:16:45.76,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Isn't that just lovely?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:51.36,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.37,0:16:54.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,H-How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.09,0:16:58.78,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Aya-chan passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.51,0:17:06.77,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Seriously, human lives are so damn short.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:09.01,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Um, how about some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:12.02,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm fine for now. Thanks for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.02,0:17:13.04,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.00,0:17:16.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not gonna play it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:17.77,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,After he gave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:19.77,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I don't know how to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:22.81,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Aya-chan was always \Nthe one in charge of playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.51,0:17:25.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:29.39,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I should have looked into it more first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:34.00,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Let me apologize as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:39.94,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,You did all of this for me, \Nbut I said those awful things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:42.83,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No, I did it for the videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:46.96,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,If I'd acted sooner, \NI might have seen her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.78,0:17:54.09,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,No, if I'd just had the courage \Nto face her back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:58.15,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,But I was too scared that she might hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:02.67,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I always make the wrong decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.03,0:18:06.23,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.78,0:18:08.23,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Got a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:11.98,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We found this in the guitar case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.92,0:18:22.67,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,Huh? Is this thing already on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:25.25,DefaultItalics,Aya's Friend,0,0,0,,Sure is. Introduce yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:28.32,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,Hey. I'm Aya, a singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:30.06,DefaultItalics,Aya's Friend,0,0,0,,Great, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.35,0:18:33.54,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:39.20,DefaultItalics,Aya's Friend,0,0,0,,Today I'm here to interview the Japanese \Nartist making big, {\i0}big{\i1} waves in America!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:40.57,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,Is that sarcasm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:42.52,DefaultItalics,Aya's Friend,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:44.51,DefaultItalics,Aya's Friend,0,0,0,,It'll be true soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:45.52,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:49.73,DefaultItalics,Aya's Friend,0,0,0,,Once you make it big, this video \Nwill be worth its weight in gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.73,0:18:50.67,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:52.73,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:54.29,DefaultItalics,Aya's Friend,0,0,0,,Let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:55.74,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,Ask me anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.74,0:18:59.22,DefaultItalics,Aya's Friend,0,0,0,,In a few words, can you tell us \Nwhy you decided to go into singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:05.88,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,A long time ago, back in my slightly wild era,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.88,0:19:08.85,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,there was only one person I was tight with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:11.81,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,I guess it started when I met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:14.27,DefaultItalics,Aya's Friend,0,0,0,,So she was the one who gave you that push?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.27,0:19:15.62,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.62,0:19:16.67,DefaultItalics,Aya's Friend,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:18.99,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,She was a real killer singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.99,0:19:21.14,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,If I was with her, we could go pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.14,0:19:24.14,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,The two of us in the big leagues... \Nor so I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:24.93,DefaultItalics,Aya's Friend,0,0,0,,You thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.93,0:19:28.08,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,We suddenly lost touch, and that was that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:32.13,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,She ran away from me, without telling me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:34.77,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,On the day of our audition, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:36.90,DefaultItalics,Aya's Friend,0,0,0,,Maybe she had her reasons?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:39.55,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,I'm sure she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:41.33,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,But I wish she'd told me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:43.29,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,It's seriously a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.29,0:19:47.04,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,I always figured we were real close,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:49.48,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,but it turns out there was a lot \NI didn't know about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.03,0:19:54.33,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,Still, I had fun singing together \Nwith her every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.11,0:19:59.81,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,I bet she... I bet Fu had fun as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.81,0:20:02.43,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,There's no doubt in my mind about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:04.86,DefaultItalics,Aya's Friend,0,0,0,,Um, you lost me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:06.85,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,No surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.21,0:20:09.06,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,Well, what I mean is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:12.12,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,If she's out there singing to this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:13.88,DefaultItalics,Aya,0,0,0,,that'd make me really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:15.47,DefaultItalics,Band Member 1,0,0,0,,Hey, is that Aya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.47,0:20:17.10,DefaultItalics,Band Member 2,0,0,0,,Hey, you recording something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:18.94,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:22.22,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,For running away by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:24.14,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,For disappearing without a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.65,0:20:27.50,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,For not seeing you \Nwhile you were still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.90,0:20:29.62,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:35.12,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,All I ever wanted was to sing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.94,0:20:37.24,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Aya-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:05.99,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.34,0:21:08.68,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Not bad for something \Nwe cobbled together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.68,0:21:11.81,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We did all this for you, \Nso show a little gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:13.15,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.01,0:21:25.51,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:29.92,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Just firing myself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.57,0:23:18.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay, all good!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.42,0:23:28.01,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Live-sama, I brought back \Nsouvenirs from New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.01,0:23:28.59,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What'd you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.59,0:23:31.78,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,A wall pennant, a Statue of Liberty \Ntrinket, a t-shirt, bath soaks...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.78,0:23:33.12,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The bath soaks, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:35.18,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,How nice! You'll be in New Soak City!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:35.81,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.81,0:23:38.43,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Next time: \N"Blood-or-Die! Desert Island Survival"!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.51,0:23:38.43,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H504042&}Blood-or-Die! Desert Island Survival
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.43,0:23:40.02,Default,Live,0,0,0,,As in, New York City!
